# desktop -- lean, headed Fedora. The default.
#
# Xfce, not Plasma: measured 2.89 GB against Plasma's 3.71 GB for the same
# capability. If you want Plasma, build `desktop-plasma` -- it is one word,
# which is the whole point of profiles.
#
# Firefox arrives as a Flatpak on first boot and updates itself daily, so it
# is not in this image at all. Anything else you want is `flatpak install`.
00-core
10-shell
30-desktop-xfce
40-flatpak
